{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "NSCameraUsageDescription" : {
      "comment" : "vSMS never opens the camera. The string exists because build 32 was REJECTED with ITMS-90683: WebRTC.framework links AVCaptureDevice and AVCaptureSession, and Apple's static check requires a purpose string for any linked sensitive API whether or not the app calls it. Keep the wording honest — iOS would show this verbatim if anything ever did ask.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMS does not use your camera. This notice is required because the calling component the app is built on also supports video calls, which vSMS does not offer."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMS verwendet Ihre Kamera nicht. Dieser Hinweis ist erforderlich, weil die Anrufkomponente der App auch Videoanrufe unterstützt, die vSMS nicht anbietet."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMS no usa tu cámara. Este aviso es necesario porque el componente de llamadas de la app también admite videollamadas, que vSMS no ofrece."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMS n'utilise pas votre caméra. Cet avis est requis car le composant d'appel de l'app prend aussi en charge la vidéo, que vSMS ne propose pas."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMS non usa la tua fotocamera. Questo avviso è richiesto perché il componente per le chiamate dell'app supporta anche le videochiamate, che vSMS non offre."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMSはカメラを使用しません。アプリの通話コンポーネントがvSMSでは提供していないビデオ通話にも対応しているため、この記載が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O vSMS não usa sua câmera. Este aviso é necessário porque o componente de chamadas do app também oferece vídeo, o que o vSMS não disponibiliza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" : {
      "comment" : "Shown by iOS the first time the user places or answers a call on their rented second number. Info.plist strings are NOT covered by Localizable.xcstrings — they need this separate catalog, which is why six locales read English here until it was added.\n\n🔴 THE \"en\" ENTRY IS LOAD-BEARING AND WAS MISSING UNTIL 2026-08-07. A key with no source-language value does NOT fall back to the INFOPLIST_KEY_* build setting — Xcode's catalog compiler emits the KEY ITSELF as the value, so en.lproj/InfoPlist.strings read \"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription\" and that literal is what iOS showed English users on their first call. Caught only because Apple flagged the camera twin with ITMS-90738; the microphone one had been shipping silently since calling landed. Every key in this file needs an explicit \"en\".",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMS uses the microphone so you can talk during calls placed from your rented number."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMS verwendet das Mikrofon, damit Sie bei Anrufen über Ihre gemietete Nummer sprechen können."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMS usa el micrófono para que puedas hablar en las llamadas desde tu número alquilado."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMS utilise le microphone pour que vous puissiez parler pendant les appels passés depuis votre numéro loué."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vSMS usa il microfono per farti parlare durante le chiamate dal tuo numero in affitto."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "レンタル番号での通話中に話せるように、vSMSはマイクを使用します。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O vSMS usa o microfone para você falar nas chamadas feitas pelo seu número alugado."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.1"
}
